# Model files gRParse loads from GRPARSE_MODELS_DIR (/models in the images).
# One entry per line, whitespace separated; # starts a comment.
#
#   path  sha256  size-in-bytes  group  license  url
#
# path   is relative to the models directory.
# group  decides when scripts/fetch-models.sh fetches the file:
#          ocr             always; the server refuses to start without them
#          layout-heron    --layout heron (the default) or all
#          layout-picodet  --layout picodet or all
#          table           always (optional to the server)
#          figure-upstream always; the published export, patched into `figure`
#          figure          always; derived, never downloaded (url patch:<source>)
#          tokenizer       --tokenizer only
# url    is the upstream download, or patch:<path> for a file the script
#        derives by running scripts/patch_figure_classifier.py on <path>.
#
# Every sha256 is the byte-exact file the server was verified with; a
# download that hashes differently is a different model and is refused.
# models/README.md carries each model's label map and preprocessing notes.

